## Recent System Improvements (2026)

### ✅ Parameter Optimization (Latest Jan 2026)
- **Loosened Confidence Thresholds**: Mean reversion and grid trading lowered to 0.45 (from 0.6)
- **Enhanced Regime Detection**: Added TRENDING_MODERATE regime for better market adaptation
- **Improved Grid Spacing**: Reduced to 0.4x ATR for tighter grid formation
- **Expanded RSI Ranges**: Mean reversion now uses 35/65 (from 30/70) for more signals
- **Lowered Liquidation Triggers**: Price move 2.5% and volume spike 2.5x for faster detection

### ✅ Grid Trading Enhancements (Jan 2026)
- **Partial Grid Unwind**: Keep trend-aligned positions when regime changes
- **Dynamic Grid Sizing**: Reduced levels to 8 for faster deployment and management
- **Enhanced Safety**: Stricter ADX monitoring with 25.0 threshold for regime change detection
- **Multi-Regime Support**: Now active in RANGING_VOLATILE, RANGING_CALM, and optionally INDECISIVE

### ✅ Modern Development Toolchain (Latest)
- **Integrated Ruff**: Added modern Python linting with auto-fix capabilities
- **Enhanced Coverage**: Improved test coverage reporting with missing line indicators
- **Performance Testing**: Added dedicated performance benchmark test suite
- **Better Error Handling**: Enhanced error messages and user feedback mechanisms

### ✅ Hub System Enhancements (Jan 2026)
- **Circuit Breaker**: Resilience patterns for database operations
